    "documentTitle": "Applied Bioinformatics Mentorship Form",
    "description": "We are recruiting motivated Nigerian graduates for a mentorship and applied bioinformatics training program.\n\n- 12 successful applicants will be selected.\n- Selected mentees will be mentored and trained in computational biology skills.\n- The program will culminate in a research project and manuscript publication.\n\nEligibility:\n- Nigerian graduate (any bioscience-related field preferred).\n- Interest in computational biology / bioinformatics.\n- Commitment to completing the mentorship and research project."
